_paragraph\" ><strong>Hex Exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hex you navigate to will provide the character a power up of some kind or an event. Sometime the player will have to fight an enemy before acquiring the bonus. Hexes have both rarity and category. Search for your choice of rare hexes or perhaps you want to concentrate on an individual stat within the same category.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963470/extras/e852e83980175cb2612a2ea9269705c3.poster.avif?t=1758913034\" width=600 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963470/extras/e852e83980175cb2612a2ea9269705c3.webm?t=1758913034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963470/extras/e852e83980175cb2612a2ea9269705c3.mp4?t=1758913034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Levelling</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing cards will give that individual card experience that will persist throughout a single game's playthrough. As cards level up their effects scale up. Repeatedly playing the same card will level it up quicker than the rest of your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artifacts</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artifacts and unique power ups that can greatly change your play style or deck construction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963470/extras/6e8628c0b2935166a863ec23bc398b35.poster.avif?t=17589130